%% Spid3r Store — HTTP request lifecycle
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant S as server.matrix (main)
    participant A as Application (Foundation)
    participant G as Global Pipeline
    participant R as Router (Http)
    participant RM as Route Middleware
    participant C as Controller
    participant V as View (SpiderBD)

    B->>S: HTTP request
    S->>A: create_application() then handle_request()
    A->>G: CorsMiddleware → SecurityHeaders → RequestId
    G->>R: dispatch method + path
    alt route matched
        R->>RM: resolve aliases (throttle:5,60 · role:admin · permission:*)
        RM->>C: handler(req) — req.auth, req.session, CSRF checked
        C->>V: view("admin/table", ctx) or json(...)
        V-->>B: HTML / JSON Response (+ Set-Cookie, CSP, nosniff)
    else no match
        R-->>B: 404 ErrorRenderer page (security headers intact)
    end
